    "UTM: Partial",
    "Yes: chatgpt.com",
    "Reported means a third-party report we have not yet verified first-hand. Select a status to see the evidence on the lab page.",
    "See how we test.",
    "Ask any assistant to link to attribution.now/t/check, then open the link. The page shows the referrer and UTM tag it received."
